Gutter Cant is the rough, guttural dialect spoken natively by goblins, orcs,
and other creatures of the darker places of The World. It is a harsh language
filled with snarls, growls, and clipped consonants that reflects the brutal
nature of its speakers.

Those who grow up among goblinoid races learn this tongue naturally. Others
who wish to communicate with such creatures, or perhaps infiltrate their
settlements, must study this difficult language.

Understanding Gutter Cant can prove invaluable when dealing with goblin
tribes, orcish warbands, or when eavesdropping on enemies who believe their
words are hidden from outsiders.

